[stderr] +**Edges and release boundary.** No diagnostic data is a valid state; malformed events are discarded; denied consent disables non-essential telemetry; offline queues only where approved or discards safely; no remote account conflict; recovery never exposes personal data; deletion/retention requests require a later data-controller policy. Live status, on-call, support SLAs, analytics, multiplayer moderation, account identity, purchases/refunds and seasonal operations are not first-release dependencies and require decisions.
