[stderr] +**Entities and lifecycle.** `AccessibilityPreference` and `LocalePreference` are selected, validated, applied and persisted. `CaptionEvent` is emitted with relevant audio, displayed, then dismissed. `Asset` moves authored → reviewed/licensed-original → packaged → referenced → retired. `FeedbackEvent` is emitted from game state and presented through permitted visual/audio channels.
