[stderr] +**Rules, inputs, dependencies, and outcome.** Text, captions, contrast/visual options and accessible controls apply in title, dialogue, combat, inventory, quest and settings UI. Required gameplay information has a readable visual/text channel; feedback must be distinguishable without colour or sound alone. Authoring inputs include original art/audio, palette/readability rules, caption text, localisation keys and accessibility acceptance cases. Dependencies: UI, content, input, all gameplay domains and packaging. Outcome: player can perceive and operate the campaign in their chosen configuration.
